{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["For resources, see Category:Resources."]],["p",["For an index to the completed minerals collection, see ",["l","收集品#Minerals","Collections"],"."]],["p",["Minerals are items that can be found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". Most minerals are acquired from ",["l","矿物#Geodes","geodes"]," after having ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," ",["l","铁匠铺#Process Geodes","process"]," them. Some are found on the ground and some ",["l","采矿","can be mined"]," from nodes, which are also found in the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],". They can also sometimes be acquired as ",["l","怪物","Monster Drops"],", as gifts from ",["l","居民","Villagers"],", or from the ",["l","无尽财富之雕像","Statue of Endless Fortune"],". Minerals (other than geode minerals) are also possible items found in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chest"],"s."]],["p",["Minerals can be donated to the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"]," for ",["l","博物馆#Donation Rewards","rewards"]," and ",["l","成就","achievements"],". Minerals not yet donated will have an item description of \"",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]," can tell you more about this if you donate it to the museum.\" After one of that mineral has been donated, the item's description will appear. There are 53 different minerals which can be donated."]],["p",["All Minerals, Gems, and Geodes can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," located inside ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house to ",["l","裁缝","Tailor"]," clothing, once the Sewing Machine is unlocked. All minerals, gems, and geodes can be used to ",["l","染色","dye"]," existing clothing using the Sewing Machine, and some can be used to dye clothing using Dye Pots."]],["p",["Minerals can be sold at a shipping box and also to the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],"."]]]],["Foraged Minerals",2,[["p",["Foraged minerals are found on the ground in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," and the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". They can be picked up in the same way that other ",["l","采集","forageables"]," can, and if the ",["l","采集#Foraging Skill","Gatherer profession"]," is chosen at Foraging level 5 then the player has a chance of a double harvest. They are used in crafting recipes and in the Boiler Room."]],["p",["Note that picking up foraged minerals normally does not award Foraging XP, but a ",["l","采集#Bugs","bug"]," results in 7 Foraging XP awarded only for a duplicate mineral created by the Gatherer profession."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Gemologist Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Location"]},{"h":1,"v":["Used in"]}],[[["f","Quartz.png",48]],[["l","石英","Quartz"]],["A clear crystal commonly found in caves and mines."],["25g"],["32g"],[["l","矿井","The Mines"]," (Floors 1-120)",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"],["l","石魔","Stone Golem (10%)"]],["Boiler Room\n",["i","(O)338","Refined Quartz"],["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond (Quest)"]]],[[["f","Earth_Crystal.png",48]],[["l","地晶","Earth Crystal"]],["A resinous substance found near the surface."],["50g"],["65g"],[["l","矿井","The Mines"]," (Floors 1-39)",["l","掘地虫","Duggy (10%)"],["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull (1.3%)"],["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chest"],["i","(T)Pan","Panning"],["i","(O)535","Geode"],["i","(O)749","Omni Geode"],["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]],["Boiler Room\n",["l","土之图腾柱","Earth Obelisk"],["i","(BC)24","Mayonnaise Machine"],["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond (Quest)"]]],[[["f","Frozen_Tear.png",48]],[["l","泪晶","Frozen Tear"]],["A crystal fabled to be the frozen tears of a yeti."],["75g"],["97g"],[["l","矿井","The Mines"]," (Floors 40-79)",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chest"],["i","(T)Pan","Panning"],["i","(O)536","Frozen Geode"],["i","(O)749","Omni Geode"],["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite (2%)"],["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]],["Boiler Room\n",["i","(O)521","Warrior Ring"],["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]," (Loved Gift)",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond (Quest)"]]],[[["f","Fire_Quartz.png",48]],[["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]],["A glowing red crys